codex
The source checks support the revised design, but a few brief edits remain. The token-count method needs a generic signature with an explicit Orbit fallback. Chunking also needs to preserve the chosen attention path and forced-flash errors. I found two smaller API issues: the proposed `validate()` name conflicts with Pydantic’s method, and the encoder needs an empty `get_output_layers()` implementation for its optimizer test.

